    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this great Mahjong game, you have to come along on a fantastic treasure hunt in ancient Greece!\u00a0</strong>Join the famous adventurer David Deanfield on his most mysterious mission yet - the one that will change everything!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail of ancient heroes, past the Oracle of Delphi and the Theatre of Dionysus to discover the mysteries surrounding the Gods of Olympus!\u00a0Uncover the treasures of this once-splendid culture. But keep your guard up: you\u2019re not alone ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 300 layouts, 11 game modes and three difficulty levels in Classic Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 7 bonus tiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Customizable tile sets, backgrounds and music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Easily create your own layouts using the editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Including step-by-step demonstrations</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this great Mahjong game, you have to come along on a fantastic treasure hunt in ancient Greece!\u00a0</strong>Join the famous adventurer David Deanfield on his most mysterious mission yet - the one that will change everything!\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the trail of ancient heroes, past the Oracle of Delphi and the Theatre of Dionysus to discover the mysteries surrounding the Gods of Olympus!\u00a0Uncover the treasures of this once-splendid culture. But keep your guard up: you\u2019re not alone ...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 300 layouts, 11 game modes and three difficulty levels in Classic Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 7 bonus tiles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Customizable tile sets, backgrounds and music</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Easily create your own layouts using the editor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Including step-by-step demonstrations</p>",
